I come home.
Now I am in my flat.
I change my clothes.
I put on comfortable clothes.
Now I go to the kitchen.
My kitchen is very quiet.
I cook dinner.
I prepare a simple meal.
I wash the vegetables.
I cut a tomato.
Now I open my new masala dabba.
It is a steel box.
There are various spices in the box.
I add them to the food.
The smell of the food is good.
Now I feel at peace.
I am very happy.
The dinner is ready.
Now I eat my food.
